# The Next Hello / act 1
# Stable IDs belong to saves. Change the wording, keep the IDs.
# Story predicates are read-only; Send applies consequences in HelloStory.

~ invite
system: 01 / A chance encounter [ID:invite.title]
system: Random matchmaking pairs you with mizuki for a garden run. You have never met. [ID:invite.line.0]
mizuki: hey :) first time in this garden? [ID:invite.line.1]
mizuki: i can take the lantern if u watch the path? [ID:invite.line.2]
- Deal. Slow and steady. I'd like to see the garden. [ID:invite.reply.0]
	=> END
- I'll take the lantern. You can stop me walking into things. [ID:invite.reply.1]
	=> END
=> END

~ bridge
system: The crooked bridge [ID:bridge.title]
system: A stone bridge crosses the dark water. A second lantern flickers on the far bank. [ID:bridge.line.0]
mizuki: shortcut should be fine lol [ID:bridge.line.1]
mizuki: i did fall in last time. should probably mention that [ID:bridge.line.2]
- Let's light the stepping stones. I'll wait for you. [ID:bridge.reply.0]
	=> END
- Want to try the bridge together? We can be damp legends. [ID:bridge.reply.1]
	=> END
=> END

~ splash
system: A small detour [ID:splash.title]
system: The bridge folds into the water. Two tiny characters respawn under the same leaf. [ID:splash.line.0]
mizuki: okay. nice leaf though [ID:splash.line.1]
system: You save a screenshot of the two of you under the leaf. [ID:splash.line.2]
- Next time, we take the stones. Keeping the screenshot though. [ID:splash.reply.0]
	=> END
=> END

~ first_dm
system: A new conversation [ID:first_dm.title]
