~ night
system: A little after eleven [ID:night.title]
mizuki: back. lid defeated :) hi asahi [ID:night.line.0]
mizuki: i draw for work. six versions of the same window today. needed to look at something else [ID:night.line.1]
mizuki: you playing again this weekend? or we could do something else. if you want [ID:night.line.2]
- Another garden run this weekend? We could play together again. [ID:night.reply.0]
	=> END
